    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the House of Fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this atmospheric and enigmatic roulette experience, you don\u2019t just gamble with chips - you gamble with perception, instinct, and the unknown. Interpret the signs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your bets wisely - red or black, odd or even, lucky numbers or sweeping ranges. Every spin tests your resolve. Every win draws you closer to salvation. Every loss, closer to the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play round after round, trying to decode the shifting patterns and paranormal cues. Save your soul or lose it here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of roulette mechanics and supernatural deduction </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 cryptic magical 8-ball responses to interpret Immersive, cinematic atmosphere with dynamic paranormal events </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal controls, maximum tension - the casino pulls the strings Do you trust your instincts - or the whispers of the beyond? Spin the wheel. Challenge the house. Embrace the unknown.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you trust your instincts \u2014 or the whispers of the beyond?<br>Spin the wheel. Challenge the house. Embrace the unknown.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the House of Fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this atmospheric and enigmatic roulette experience, you don\u2019t just gamble with chips - you gamble with perception, instinct, and the unknown. Interpret the signs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your bets wisely - red or black, odd or even, lucky numbers or sweeping ranges. Every spin tests your resolve. Every win draws you closer to salvation. Every loss, closer to the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play round after round, trying to decode the shifting patterns and paranormal cues. Save your soul or lose it here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of roulette mechanics and supernatural deduction </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 cryptic magical 8-ball responses to interpret Immersive, cinematic atmosphere with dynamic paranormal events </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal controls, maximum tension - the casino pulls the strings Do you trust your instincts - or the whispers of the beyond? Spin the wheel. Challenge the house. Embrace the unknown.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you trust your instincts \u2014 or the whispers of the beyond?<br>Spin the wheel. Challenge the house. Embrace the unknown.</p>",
